<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czechs give priority to Norwegian gas deal.</title>
<headline>Czechs give priority to Norwegian gas deal.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech government has given priority to concluding a deal with Norway as a way to diversify its natural gas supplies away from solely Russian gas, but three other options were still possible, industry minister Vladimir Dlouhy said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The basic option will be the Norwegian option,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
